<title>FRANCE: Europe needs political checks on EMU - Marchelli.</title>
<headline>Europe needs political checks on EMU - Marchelli.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Europe needs a strong political body to oversee monetary union to ensure the region is run as a democracy rather than a technocracy, Bank of France monetary policy council member Paul Marchelli said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In an interview with Reuters, he also said that while he hoped European Union leaders would agree on a budget discipline pact at a summit in Dublin this weekend, Germany would have to drop its demand for automatic sanctions on countries which ran up big budget deficits.</p>
</text>
